# Perforating Artist: "Raid" asks whether you attacked, not whether the Artist did. Bot1 attacks with only an Ornithopter on turn 3
# (0 damage), the Artist stays home, and at the end step Bot2, who controls an Island and an Ornithopter, chooses to sacrifice
# a nonland permanent: it sacrifices the Ornithopter, the only one it has, and loses no life.

